<title>USA: Graphic Industries Q1 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Graphic Industries Q1 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary profit	  $0.34     loss	 $0.21</p>
<p> Shr diluted profit	   0.32     loss	  0.21</p>
<p> Net profit		    4,000     loss	 2,400</p>
<p> Revs			  115,200		  113,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	   11,792		   11,545</p>
<p> Avg shrs diluted	   12,996		   12,825</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Quarters ended April 31.</p>
<p>Full name is Graphic Industries Inc.</p>
<p>Q1 1996 includes a one-time after-tax restructuring charge of $6 million. Without that charge, earnings would have been $3.6 million, or $0.31 per primary share ($0.30 fully diluted).</p>
</text>
